\details{
For this engine, there is a single mode: regression.
\subsection{Tuning Parameters}{

This engine has no tuning parameters. Arguments to
\code{\link[robustbase:lmrob]{robustbase::lmrob()}}, such as \code{method} or
\code{control}, can be supplied through \code{set_engine()}. The \code{penalty} and
\code{mixture} arguments to \code{linear_reg()} do not apply to this engine.
}

